---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#F5F2EB] border-b border-[#E2DDD1]" id="about">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Founder Persona & Direct Contact Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-[#0232d4] uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
            The Person Behind OTHR
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-[#0D111C] tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Direct collaboration. No middlemen.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="font-body text-base text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
          The biggest risk in hiring an agency is paying senior rates only to have your project handed to inexperienced junior subcontractors. At OTHR, you collaborate directly with the engineer writing your code.
        </p>

        <!-- Founder Card -->
        <div class="p-6 bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] rounded-2xl space-y-4 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#EDE9DF] border border-[#D1CABE] flex items-center justify-center font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#0232d4]">
              SS
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-[#0D111C]">Shiva Sajay</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-neutral-600">Founder & Lead Engineer</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-[#E2DDD1] space-y-2.5 text-xs">
            <a
              href="tel:+919995228904"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-700 hover:text-[#0232d4] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Direct Phone:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                +91 99952 28904
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="mailto:shivasajay23@gmail.com"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-700 hover:text-[#0232d4] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Direct Email:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                shivasajay23@gmail.com
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://x.com/NiraaStudio"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="flex items-center justify-between text-neutral-700 hover:text-[#0B3C85] transition-colors py-1 group"
            >
              <span class="font-mono text-neutral-500">Updates on X:</span>
              <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                @NiraaStudio
                <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={13} />
              </span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Authentic Founder Note & Standards -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        
        <!-- Note Body -->
        <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-base text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I started OTHR with a straightforward thesis: <strong class="text-[#0D111C]">great software does not require an army of account managers or months of bureaucratic meetings</strong>. It requires an engineer who genuinely understands your business constraints, communicates clearly, and delivers what was promised.
          </p>

          <p>
            Having built internal systems for automotive dealerships (automating end-of-month payroll pipelines for 2,500+ employees under strict Meta WhatsApp API burst limits) as well as interactive 3D browser tools, I know that real engineering begins where tutorials end.
          </p>

          <p>
            When we work together:
          </p>

          <!-- 3 Concrete Pillars -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-[#0232d4] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">01 / Clarity</div>
              <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm text-[#0D111C] mb-1">Zero Jargon</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600">Plain English explanations of what we are building, why, and how it works.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-[#0232d4] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">02 / Predictability</div>
              <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm text-[#0D111C] mb-1">Fixed Scopes</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600">Defined deliverables, rapid sprint timelines (1–4 weeks), and zero invoice surprises.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 bg-white border border-[#E2DDD1] rounded-xl shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-[#0232d4] font-mono font-bold text-xs mb-1">03 / Reliability</div>
              <div class="font-display font-semibold text-sm text-[#0D111C] mb-1">Real Accountability</div>
              <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600">I test, deploy, and verify everything myself. If something breaks, I fix it.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
            <a
              href="#contact"
              class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#0232d4] hover:bg-[#0028b0] text-[#F5F2EB] font-bold text-sm rounded-lg transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm"
            >
              <span>Work directly with Shiva</span>
              <Icon name="ArrowUpRight" size={15} />
            </a>
            <a
              href="/studio"
              class="px-5 py-3.5 bg-[#EDE9DF] hover:bg-white text-[#0D111C] border border-[#D1CABE] font-medium text-sm rounded-lg transition-colors"
            >
              Read studio origin
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
